  Rigged Mic Might Reasonably Explain:

  Why bomb dogs were kept away from the scene of the crime.

  Why the crime scene was immediately paved over, and the soil was excavated

  (explosive residue).

  Why the Feds were searching for Charlie Kirk's necklace {explosive residue).

  Why there appears to be shattered black plastic/glass all over the SUV which

  transported Charlie to the Hospital. (RODE Mic shattered)

  Why there is no available footage or any eyewitness reports of someone

  seen firing a shot from the Losee building.

  Why the Feds did not conduct a standard GSR test when Tyler Robinson was

  brought in.

  Why Tarryl Farnsworth violated the crime scene to remove the back footage.

  Why there was unusually, no ambulance on standby {paramedics would have

  seen the shattered RODE mic pieces and other evidence which did not

  support a gun shot).

  Why Erika forgave Tyler Robinson quicker than she forgave Druski.


